# Dockerfile.starfish-build and Dockerfile.android-build are built with the
# repository root as their context so that COPY paths stay repo-relative, but a
# working tree carries tens of gigabytes of build output. Ship only what they
# actually COPY: docker/, a few hundred kilobytes.
#
# The Windows MSVC-on-Wine cross-build image is not built from this repository
# at all -- it lives in the separate internal starfish_build_on_docker repo.
*
!docker
